### Heading 3

This is a *bold* word, this is _italic_, this is +underline+, and this
is ~strikethrough~. You can `inline code` too.

A paragraph that spans
two lines joins with a single space when rendered.

The next paragraph has a hard break inside it.\
This line breaks within the same paragraph.

> A blockquote.
>> Nested one level deeper.
> Back to the outer.

1. Ordered list item one
2. Ordered list item two
3. Ordered list item three

- Bullet item
